OL,3,GNEWSA'I chase shoplifters from my store
OL,4,Aaged eight to 82'
OL,5,
OL,6,FConvenience store owner Pal Mann has
OL,7,Fmany tasks, with one - spotting
OL,8,Fshoplifters - seemingly as regular as
OL,9,Fopening up.
OL,11,FAs the issue gets "progressively
OL,12,Fworse", thefts are not isolated to a
OL,13,Fparticular age group, he says.
OL,15,F"We see young kids, from eight or nine
OL,16,Fyears old," he told the BBC. "The
OL,17,Foldest I've ever collared was an
OL,18,F82-year-old woman."
