OL,3,GNEWSA'I chase shoplifters from my store
OL,4,Aaged eight to 82'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has run Select and Save in Harborne,
OL,7,FBirmingham, for 21 years and estimates
OL,8,Fhe has banned more than 200 thieves
OL,9,Fduring that time.
